+	/* BC-250: the PASID flush does not find KFD's VMIDs (ROCm#6313). Without
+	 * HWS a process keeps one static VMID while it has queues: flush that one,
+	 * as amdgpu did before PASID flushes (bc250 no-HWS vmid flush).
+	 */
